       sseetthhoossttiidd() can fail with the following errors:

       EEAACCCCEESS The caller did not have permission to write to the file used  to
              store the host ID.

       EEPPEERRMM  The calling process’s effective user or group ID is not the same
              as its corresponding real ID.

