       _/_e_t_c_/_h_o_s_t_i_d.  (Before glibc 2.2, the file _/_v_a_r_/_a_d_m_/_h_o_s_t_i_d was used.)

       In the glibc implementation, if ggeetthhoossttiidd() cannot open the file
